<h2>Curi Curi</h2>
<p>Curio Curio's second record is the one where the <em>jangle</em> finally gives way
to something heavier. I first heard it at <a href="https://curiocurio.bandcamp.com/album/curi-curi" rel="ugc nofollow noopener">Bandcamp Friday</a> <small class="host">curiocurio.bandcamp.com</small>
and have not stopped.</p>
